
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#fbf4f0">
<title>Andi & Putri — Wedding Invitation</title>

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600&family=Great+Vibes&family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
:root {
  --pink: #d7a5a2;
  --pink-light: #f6e6e2;
  --cream: #fbf6ef;
  --sage: #879781;
  --green: #465b48;
  --text: #554c48;
  --white: #fffdf9;
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
html { scroll-behavior: smooth; scroll-padding-top: 20px; }
body {
  font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
  color: var(--text);
  background: var(--cream);
  line-height: 1.8;
  overflow-x: hidden;
}
button, input, textarea, select { font: inherit; }
button, a { -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; }
a { color: inherit; }
img { display: block; max-width: 100%; }
h2 {
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: clamp(28px, 5vw, 42px);
  line-height: 1.3;
}
.script {
  font-family: 'Great Vibes', cursive;
  font-weight: 400;
  line-height: 1.3;
}
.eyebrow {
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 3px;
  font-size: 10px;
  color: var(--sage);
  font-weight: 600;
}
.section {
  padding: 78px 20px;
  text-align: center;
}
.inner { max-width: 850px; margin: auto; }
.subtitle { font-size: 13px; color: #82746c; }
.flower {
  color: var(--pink);
  font-size: 26px;
  margin: 15px 0;
}
.btn {
  border: 0;
  border-radius: 30px;
  padding: 12px 23px;
  display: inline-flex;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  background: var(--green);
  color: white;
  text-decoration: none;
  cursor: pointer;
  font-size: 13px;
  transition: .25s;
}
.btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); opacity: .9; }
.btn-light { background: white; color: var(--green); }
.btn-outline {
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--green);
  border: 1px solid #b9c2b4;
}
.script-name {
  font-family: 'Great Vibes', cursive;
  font-size: clamp(48px, 10vw, 76px);
  color: var(--green);
}
.divider {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 14px;
  color: var(--pink);
  margin: 18px auto;
}
.divider::before, .divider::after {
  content: '';
  width: 45px;
  height: 1px;
  background: #ddc6ba;
}

/* COVER */
#cover {
  min-height: 100svh;
  position: fixed;
  z-index: 20;
  inset: 0;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 25px;
  color: white;
  background:
    linear-gradient(180deg, #3b443e4a, #293a2c99),
    url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519741497674-611481863552?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=85')
    center/cover;
  transition: opacity .9s ease, visibility .9s ease;
}
#cover.closed {
  opacity: 0;
  visibility: hidden;
  pointer-events: none;
}
.cover-content {
  width: min(100%, 500px);
  animation: floatIn 1.3s both;
}
.cover-flower { font-size: 35px; color: #f3d6d1; }
.cover-label {
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 4px;
  margin: 16px 0;
}
.cover-title {
  font-family: 'Great Vibes', cursive;
  font-size: clamp(65px, 13vw, 100px);
  line-height: 1.25;
  margin: 15px 0;
  font-weight: 400;
}
.cover-to { font-size: 13px; margin: 10px 0 22px; }
#guestName { font-weight: 600; color: #ffe8df; }
@keyframes floatIn {
  from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(25px); }
  to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
}

/* HERO */
.hero {
  min-height: 90svh;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 65px 20px;
  background:
    linear-gradient(#faf4ecb5, #faf4ece8),
    url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1497250681960-ef046c08a56e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85')
    center/cover;
}
.hero h1 { margin: 15px 0; }
.hero-date { margin-top: 25px; font-size: 13px; }

/* COUNTDOWN */
.countdown {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 10px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  margin: 25px 0;
}
.count-box {
  min-width: 68px;
  background: #fffaf5;
  border: 1px solid #ead9d1;
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 13px 9px;
}
.count-box strong {
  display: block;
  font-size: 25px;
  color: var(--green);
  line-height: 1.5;
}
.count-box span { font-size: 10px; }

/* COUPLE */
.couple-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 24px;
  margin-top: 35px;
}
.person { padding: 15px; }
.person img {
  width: min(100%, 290px);
  height: 340px;
  object-fit: cover;
  margin: 0 auto 22px;
  border-radius: 150px 150px 12px 12px;
  border: 5px solid white;
  box-shadow: 0 8px 30px #7e665018;
}
.person h3 {
  font: 500 24px 'Playfair Display', serif;
  color: var(--green);
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}
.person p { font-size: 12px; }

/* EVENT */
.event-section { background: var(--pink-light); }
.event-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  gap: 18px;
  margin-top: 30px;
}
.event-card {
  background: var(--white);
  border: 1px solid #ead9d1;
  border-radius: 16px;
  padding: 28px 18px;
}
.event-card h3 {
  font: 500 25px 'Playfair Display', serif;
  margin: 8px 0 15px;
}
.event-card p { font-size: 12px; margin: 5px 0; }
.event-icon { font-size: 28px; }

/* GALLERY */
.gallery-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 12px;
  margin-top: 30px;
}
.gallery-grid img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 230px;
  object-fit: cover;
  border-radius: 12px;
  transition: transform .35s;
}
.gallery-grid img:hover { transform: scale(1.025); }

/* GIFT */
.gift-section {
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f6e6e2, #fbf6ef);
}
.gift-icon {
  width: 78px;
  height: 78px;
  margin: 0 auto 20px;
  border: 1px solid #d9b9af;
  background: #fffaf5;
  border-radius: 50%;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  font-size: 34px;
}
.gift-card {
  max-width: 460px;
  margin: 30px auto 0;
  padding: 27px 24px;
  background: white;
  border-radius: 18px;
  border: 1px solid #e9d8ce;
  box-shadow: 0 10px 35px #5b45310a;
}
.bank-label {
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 2px;
  color: var(--sage);
  text-transform: uppercase;
}
.account-number {
  font-size: clamp(21px, 5vw, 28px);
  letter-spacing: 1px;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--green);
  margin: 15px 0 3px;
  overflow-wrap: anywhere;
}
.account-owner { font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 18px; }

/* FORMS */
.form-card {
  max-width: 540px;
  margin: 28px auto;
  padding: 25px;
  text-align: left;
  border-radius: 16px;
  border: 1px solid #e8d9ce;
  background: white;
}
.form-card label {
  display: block;
  font-size: 12px;
  margin: 12px 0 5px;
}
.form-card input, .form-card select,
.form-card textarea {
  width: 100%;
  border: 1px solid #e4d9d1;
  border-radius: 9px;
  padding: 12px;
  background: #fffdf9;
  color: var(--text);
  outline-color: var(--sage);
}
.form-card textarea { resize: vertical; }
.form-card .btn { margin-top: 16px; width: 100%; }
#formStatus { margin-top: 12px; font-size: 12px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }

/* FOOTER */
footer {
  padding: 45px 20px;
  background: var(--green);
  color: white;
  text-align: center;
}
footer .script { font-size: 52px; margin: 10px; }
footer p { font-size: 11px; }

.reveal {
  opacity: 0;
  transform: translateY(22px);
  transition: opacity .8s, transform .8s;
}
.reveal.visible { opacity: 1; transform: none; }

@media(max-width:600px) {
  .section { padding: 60px 17px; }
  .couple-grid { gap: 5px; }
  .person { padding: 5px; }
  .person img { height: 240px; }
  .person h3 { font-size: 19px; }
  .event-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .gallery-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr); gap: 8px; }
  .gallery-grid img { height: 175px; }
  .gallery-grid img:last-child { grid-column: 1 / -1; height: 220px; }
  .form-card { padding: 18px; }
}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce) {
  *, *::before, *::after {
    scroll-behavior: auto !important;
    animation-duration: .01ms !important;
    transition-duration: .01ms !important;
  }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<!-- COVER PEMBUKA -->
<div id="cover">
  <div class="cover-content">
    <div class="cover-flower">❀</div>
    <p class="cover-label">THE WEDDING OF</p>
    <h1 class="cover-title">Andi &amp; Putri</h1>
    <p class="cover-to">Kepada Yth.<br>
      <span id="guestName">Bapak/Ibu/Saudara/i</span>
    </p>
    <button class="btn btn-light" onclick="bukaUndangan()">
      ♡ Buka Undangan
    </button>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- HERO -->
<header class="hero" id="home">
  <div class="inner">
    <p class="eyebrow">Assalamu'alaikum Warahmatullahi Wabarakatuh</p>
    <div class="flower">❀</div>
    <p>Dengan memohon rahmat dan ridha Allah SWT,</p>
    <p>kami bermaksud menyelenggarakan pernikahan kami:</p>
    <h1 class="script-name">Andi &amp; Putri</h1>
    <div class="divider">❦</div>
    <p class="hero-date" id="heroDate">Sabtu, 12 Juni 2027</p>
    <div class="countdown" id="countdown">
      <div class="count-box"><strong id="days">0</strong><span>Hari</span></div>
