    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- MEMPELAI -->
<section class="section reveal" style="background:#fffaf5">
  <div class="inner">
    <p class="eyebrow">The Happy Couple</p>
    <h2>Mempelai</h2>
    <div class="couple-grid">
      <article class="person">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534528741775-53994a69daeb?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=85" alt="Foto mempelai wanita">
        <h3>Putri</h3>
        <p>Putri dari Bapak [Nama Ayah] dan Ibu [Nama Ibu]</p>
      </article>
      <article class="person">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500648767791-00dcc994a43e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=85" alt="Foto mempelai pria">
        <h3>Andi</h3>
        <p>Putra dari Bapak [Nama Ayah] dan Ibu [Nama Ibu]</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ACARA -->
<section class="section event-section reveal" id="acara">
  <div class="inner">
    <p class="eyebrow">Save the Date</p>
    <h2>Waktu &amp; Tempat</h2>
    <p>InsyaAllah acara akan diselenggarakan pada:</p>

    <div class="event-grid">
      <article class="event-card">
        <div class="event-icon">💍</div>
        <h3>Akad Nikah</h3>
        <div class="divider">✿</div>
        <p id="akadDate">Sabtu, 12 Juni 2027</p>
        <p>08.00 WIB – selesai</p>
        <p style="margin-top:15px"><strong>[Nama Gedung]</strong></p>
        <p>[Alamat lengkap lokasi]</p>
      </article>
      <article class="event-card">
        <div class="event-icon">🌷</div>
        <h3>Resepsi</h3>
        <div class="divider">✿</div>
        <p id="resepsiDate">Sabtu, 12 Juni 2027</p>
        <p>11.00–14.00 WIB</p>
        <p style="margin-top:15px"><strong>[Nama Gedung]</strong></p>
        <p>[Alamat lengkap lokasi]</p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <a class="btn" id="mapsButton" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
       href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=gedung+pernikahan">
      📍 Buka Google Maps
    </a>
    <p class="subtitle" style="margin-top:12px">
      Alamat dan jadwal di atas masih berupa contoh.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- GALERI -->
<section class="section reveal">
  <div class="inner">
    <p class="eyebrow">Our Moments</p>
    <h2>Galeri Cinta</h2>
    <div class="flower">❀</div>
    <p class="subtitle">Sepenggal cerita menuju hari bahagia kami.</p>

    <div class="gallery-grid">
      <img loading="lazy" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519741497674-611481863552?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=80" alt="Momen pernikahan 1">
      <img loading="lazy" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511285560929-80b456fea0bc?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=80" alt="Momen pernikahan 2">
      <img loading="lazy" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1532712938310-34cb3982ef74?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=80" alt="Momen pernikahan 3">
      <img loading="lazy" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1523438885200-e635ba2c371e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=80" alt="Momen pernikahan 4">
      <img loading="lazy" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1465495976277-4387d4b0e4a6?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=80" alt="Momen pernikahan 5">
      <img loading="lazy" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1469334031218-e382a71b716b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=80" alt="Momen pernikahan 6">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- WEDDING GIFT -->
<section class="section gift-section reveal" id="gift">
  <div class="inner">
    <div class="gift-icon">🎁</div>
    <p class="eyebrow">Wedding Gift</p>
    <h2>Tanda Kasih</h2>
    <div class="divider">❦</div>
    <p>
      Doa restu Anda merupakan hadiah terindah bagi kami.
      Namun, apabila ingin berbagi tanda kasih, Anda dapat
      mengirimkannya melalui rekening berikut.
    </p>

    <div class="gift-card">
      <p class="bank-label">Bank BCA · Data Contoh</p>
      <div class="account-number" id="rekening">1234567890</div>
      <p class="account-owner" id="pemilik">Andi Pratama</p>
      <button class="btn" onclick="salinRekening()">
        ▣ Salin Nomor Rekening
      </button>
    </div>

    <p id="giftStatus" role="status" aria-live="polite"
       style="font-size:12px;margin-top:12px"></p>
    <p class="subtitle" style="margin-top:20px">
      Pastikan data rekening di atas diganti dengan data penerima
      yang benar sebelum undangan dibagikan.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- RSVP DAN UCAPAN -->
<section class="section reveal" id="rsvp">
  <div class="inner">
    <p class="eyebrow">Kindly Respond</p>
    <h2>RSVP &amp; Ucapan</h2>
    <p>Konfirmasi kehadiran dan kirimkan doa terbaikmu untuk kami.</p>

    <form class="form-card" id="rsvpForm">
      <label for="namaTamu">Nama lengkap</label>
      <input id="namaTamu" name="nama" required
             placeholder="Masukkan nama kamu">

      <label for="jumlah">Jumlah tamu</label>
      <select id="jumlah" name="jumlah">
        <option value="1 orang">1 orang</option>
        <option value="2 orang">2 orang</option>
        <option value="3 orang">3 orang</option>
        <option value="4 orang">4 orang</option>
      </select>

      <label for="kehadiran">Konfirmasi kehadiran</label>
      <select id="kehadiran" name="kehadiran" required>
        <option value="">Pilih jawaban</option>
        <option value="Hadir">InsyaAllah hadir</option>
        <option value="Tidak hadir">Mohon maaf, tidak bisa hadir</option>
      </select>

      <label for="ucapan">Ucapan dan doa</label>
      <textarea id="ucapan" name="ucapan" rows="4"
                placeholder="Semoga menjadi keluarga yang sakinah..."></textarea>

      <button type="submit" class="btn">Kirim Konfirmasi via WhatsApp</button>
      <p id="formStatus" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- PENUTUP -->
<section class="section reveal" style="background:#fffaf5">
  <div class="inner">
    <div class="flower">❀</div>
    <h2>Terima Kasih</h2>
    <p>
      Merupakan kebahagiaan bagi kami atas kehadiran,
      doa, dan restu yang diberikan.
    </p>
    <h1 class="script-name" style="margin-top:20px">Andi &amp; Putri</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">Wassalamu'alaikum Warahmatullahi Wabarakatuh</p>
  </div>
</section>
</main>

<footer>
  <p>With love,</p>
  <p class="script">Andi &amp; Putri</p>
  <p>© <span id="year"></span> Wedding Invitation</p>
</footer>

<script>
/* ==========================================
   KONFIGURASI UTAMA
   Ganti nilai di bagian ini sesuai data asli.
========================================== */

const CONFIG = {
  // Format ISO: YYYY-MM-DDTHH:mm:ss+07:00
  weddingDate: "2027-06-12T08:00:00+07:00",

  // Nama penerima rekening
  bankName: "BCA",
  accountNumber: "1234567890",
  accountOwner: "Andi Pratama",

  // Nomor WhatsApp dengan kode negara, tanpa tanda +
  // Contoh Indonesia: 6281234567890
  whatsappNumber: "6281234567890",

  // Cari lokasi acara di Google Maps, lalu tempel URL-nya di sini
  mapsUrl: "https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=gedung+pernikahan"
};

/* ==========================================
   BUKA UNDANGAN
========================================== */

function bukaUndangan() {
  document.getElementById("cover").classList.add("closed");
  document.body.style.overflow = "auto";

  // Perbarui URL tanpa reload, supaya bisa dibagikan
  // dengan parameter nama tamu jika diperlukan.
  document.getElementById("home").scrollIntoView();
}

document.body.style.overflow = "hidden";

/* ==========================================
   NAMA TAMU DARI URL
   Contoh: index.html?to=Budi
========================================== */

const params = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);
const guest = params.get("to");

if (guest) {
  document.getElementById("guestName").textContent =
    guest.replace(/[<>]/g, "").slice(0, 100);
}

/* ==========================================
   COUNTDOWN
========================================== */

const targetDate = new Date(CONFIG.weddingDate).getTime();

function updateCountdown() {
  const distance = targetDate - Date.now();
  const countdown = document.getElementById("countdown");

  if (Number.isNaN(targetDate)) {
    countdown.innerHTML = "Periksa konfigurasi tanggal pernikahan.";
    return;
  }

  if (distance <= 0) {
    countdown.innerHTML = "<p>Hari bahagia telah tiba ❤️</p>";
    return;
  }

  document.getElementById("days").textContent =
    Math.floor(distance / 86400000);
  document.getElementById("hours").textContent =
    Math.floor((distance / 3600000) % 24);
  document.getElementById("minutes").textContent =
    Math.floor((distance / 60000) % 60);
  document.getElementById("seconds").textContent =
    Math.floor((distance / 1000) % 60);
}

updateCountdown();
setInterval(updateCountdown, 1000);

/* ==========================================
   TANGGAL OTOMATIS
========================================== */

const tanggal = new Date(CONFIG.weddingDate);

if (!Number.isNaN(tanggal.getTime())) {
  const tanggalFormat = new Intl.DateTimeFormat("id-ID", {
    weekday: "long",
    day: "numeric",
    month: "long",
    year: "numeric",
    timeZone: "Asia/Jakarta"
  }).format(tanggal);

  document.getElementById("heroDate").textContent = tanggalFormat;
  document.getElementById("akadDate").textContent = tanggalFormat;
  document.getElementById("resepsiDate").textContent = tanggalFormat;
}

document.getElementById("year").textContent = new Date().getFullYear();

/* ==========================================
   WEDDING GIFT
========================================== */

document.querySelector(".bank-label").textContent =
  "Bank " + CONFIG.bankName;

document.getElementById("rekening").textContent =
  CONFIG.accountNumber;

document.getElementById("pemilik").textContent =
  CONFIG.accountOwner;

async function salinRekening() {
  const status = document.getElementById("giftStatus");

  try {
    if (navigator.clipboard && window.isSecureContext) {
      await navigator.clipboard.writeText(CONFIG.accountNumber);
    } else {
      const area = document.createElement("textarea");
      area.value = CONFIG.accountNumber;
      area.style.position = "fixed";
      area.style.opacity = "0";
      document.body.appendChild(area);
      area.select();

      const berhasil = document.execCommand("copy");
      area.remove();

      if (!berhasil) throw new Error("Salin manual");
    }

    status.textContent = "✓ Nomor rekening berhasil disalin!";
  } catch (error) {
    status.textContent =
      "Salin nomor ini secara manual: " + CONFIG.accountNumber;
  }
}

/* ==========================================
   RSVP WHATSAPP
========================================== */

document.getElementById("rsvpForm").addEventListener("submit", function(e) {
  e.preventDefault();

  const nama = document.getElementById("namaTamu").value.trim();
  const jumlah = document.getElementById("jumlah").value;
  const hadir = document.getElementById("kehadiran").value;
  const ucapan = document.getElementById("ucapan").value.trim();
  const status = document.getElementById("formStatus");

  if (!nama || !hadir) {
    status.textContent = "Mohon isi nama dan konfirmasi kehadiran.";
    return;
  }

  const pesan =
    "Assalamu'alaikum, Andi & Putri!\n\n" +
    "Saya ingin mengonfirmasi undangan pernikahan:\n" +
    "Nama: " + nama + "\n" +
    "Jumlah tamu: " + jumlah + "\n" +
    "Kehadiran: " + hadir + "\n" +
    "Ucapan: " + (ucapan || "-");

  const nomor = CONFIG.whatsappNumber.replace(/\D/g, "");

  if (!nomor || nomor.length < 8) {
    status.textContent = "Nomor WhatsApp belum dikonfigurasi dengan benar.";
    return;
  }

  const url = "https://wa.me/" + nomor +
              "?text=" + encodeURIComponent(pesan);

  status.textContent = "Membuka WhatsApp untuk mengirim konfirmasi...";
  window.open(url, "_blank", "noopener,noreferrer");
});

/* ==========================================
   ANIMASI SCROLL
========================================== */

const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
  entries.forEach(entry => {
    if (entry.isIntersecting) {
      entry.target.classList.add("visible");
      observer.unobserve(entry.target);
    }
  });
}, { threshold: 0.12 });

document.querySelectorAll(".reveal").forEach(el => observer.observe(el));

/* ==========================================
   LOKASI GOOGLE MAPS
========================================== */

document.getElementById("mapsButton").href = CONFIG.mapsUrl;
</script>

